  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capital Programme Budget - To provide funding for infrastructure to create and improve ministry buildings and community centres to support mediation and conflict services.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Capital Programme Budget - To provide funding for infrastructure to create and improve ministry buildings and community centres to support mediation and conflict services. is a component of Somalia Stability Fund II reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;11,645,936. It works in the following sector(s): Decentralisation and support to subnational government, Social Protection, Public sector policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
